# <Repo> Release Lifecycle & Publishing Guide

This document defines the versioning rules, release channels and publishing procedure for
**<Repo>**.

Copy to `RELEASE_PROCESS.md` in the repository root. `N6-REL-01` requires it in any
repository whose workflows can publish a release, alongside `CHANGELOG.md`.
`N6-REL-03` also requires a build-once, test-before-publication promotion path.

Everything in angle brackets is a per-repo decision. **Delete the guidance comments as you
fill them in** - a template left half-answered reads as a decision that was made.

